#2700
vrask king kobold~
King Vrask~
King Vrask lounges on his lopsided throne, barking orders at anyone in earshot.
~
The king of the kobolds is a full head taller than any of his subjects,
which makes him very nearly four feet tall, and he carries himself as
though it were forty.  His scales are a dull rust red, his snout is
crisscrossed with old scars, and a crown of beaten copper sits crookedly
between his horns.  He clutches a scepter made from a gnome's thighbone
and taps it impatiently against the arm of his throne while he studies
the war plan on the wall.
~
