#2701
kobold warrior~
a kobold warrior~
A kobold warrior in a jerkin of patched hides drills with a short spear.
~
He is small, scaly and mean, with a doglike snout full of needle teeth
and a short spear that he handles as though he has been practicing very
hard.  He has.  His jerkin is made of a dozen different hides stitched
clumsily together, and he eyes you with the bright, nervous hostility of
a creature that knows it is going to war.
~
