kobold spearman~
a kobold spearman~
A kobold spearman stands at attention, spear held stiffly upright.
~
This kobold is one of the king's veterans, and he is trying very hard to
look like one.  He wears a jerkin of hides sewn with copper rings and
holds his spear as straight as a flagpole.  A necklace of small teeth
rattles at his throat.
~
