#2703
kobold digger~
a kobold digger~
A weary kobold digger trudges past with a bucket of rubble.
~
She is thin and covered from snout to tail in gray rock dust, and the
bucket of stones she carries is nearly as big as she is.  Her claws are
worn down to stubs, and she does not look up as you pass.  She has the
look of someone who has been digging for a very long time and expects to
dig for a great while longer.
~
