#2704
kobold shaman~
a kobold shaman~
A kobold shaman in an orange robe shakes a rattle and chants at the troops.
~
The shaman is wrapped in a robe dyed a violent orange and hung with
charms of bone, feather and copper wire.  She shakes a rattle made from
a gourd and a small skull, and chants in a high, wavering voice,
blessing spears, stakes, kobolds and anything else that holds still long
enough.
~
