a kobold war-chief~
A scarred kobold war-chief stands guard beside the throne.
~
The war-chief is broad for a kobold and covered in old scars, one of
which has taken most of his left ear.  He wears a shirt of rusted chain
several sizes too big for him, belted tight, and carries a stone
battleaxe that he keeps between the king and everyone else.
~
