kobold scout~
a kobold scout~
A kobold scout slinks through the tunnel, keeping to the shadows.
~
Lean and quick, the scout wears dark hides smeared with mud so that she
is hard to see against the rock.  A sling and a pouch of stones hang at
her belt, and her eyes dart constantly toward the darkness of the
tunnels ahead.
~
