#2707
kobold engineer~
a kobold engineer~
A kobold engineer argues with the chasm, a coil of rope over one shoulder.
~
The engineer wears a leather apron with a dozen pockets, every one of
them full of pegs, cords, nails and scraps of slate covered in
calculations.  He measures the chasm with a knotted string, scowls,
measures it again, and scribbles another figure on his slate.  The
figures do not seem to be getting any smaller.
~
