#2708
rat cave giant~
a giant cave rat~
A giant cave rat, as big as a dog, sniffs about for scraps.
~
It is a rat, but a rat the size of a hunting dog, with a naked pink tail
as long as your arm and yellow teeth like chisels.  Its fur is gray and
patchy, and it watches you with small red eyes, trying to decide whether
you count as food.
~
