#2709
troll envoy gorrug~
Gorrug, the troll envoy~
A huge, green-skinned troll leans on a club, looking bored by the kobolds' plans.
~
Gorrug is a mountain troll, nine feet of warty green hide stretched over
knotted muscle, and he has to stoop even here beneath the cavern's lofty
ceiling.  A necklace of boar tusks hangs on his chest and a club studded
with iron nails rests on his shoulder.  He has come down from the Kehrn
Mountains to see what his king's new allies are worth, and judging by
his expression, the answer so far is "not much".
~
