crayfish blind white~
a blind white crayfish~
A blind white crayfish creeps along the bottom of the pool.
~
It is a pale, ghostly crayfish as long as your hand, with no eyes at all
and long, twitching feelers that it waves through the cold water.  Its
claws are small, but they can still give you a nasty nip.
~
