#2711
gnome captive tinkerer pibb~
Pibb, a captive gnome~
A ragged gnome sits chained to an iron ring, tinkering with a pebble and a bit of wire.
~
Pibb was once a tinkerer of Gnishmire, and he still has the tinkerer's
restless hands, though the kobolds have taken every tool he owned.  His
pointed hat is torn, his beard is full of rock dust, and an iron cuff
around his ankle is chained to the wall.  He has made himself a tiny
spinning top out of a pebble and some wire, and he spins it over and
over while he watches the kobolds with clever, unhappy eyes.
~
